### Smart Loan Tracker API - Auth Endpoints
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@authToken = your-auth-token-here

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/../health

### Better Auth - Sign Up
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/sign-up/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "John Doe"
}

### Better Auth - Sign In
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Better Auth - Get Session
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/get-session
Cookie: better-auth.session_token=your-session-token

### Better Auth - Sign Out
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/sign-out
Cookie: better-auth.session_token=your-session-token

### Create User Profile (Callback)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-id-here"
}

